The engine utilities in packages/client/src/utilities/ (EventEmitter, Sizes,
Time, Resources, Debug) and the Experience/World application structure follow
the Three.js Journey course architecture created by Bruno Simon
(https://threejs-journey.com), which has become a canonical way to structure
Three.js applications. Brahma builds on that pattern with gratitude.

